      "bbox": [
        312,
        1834,
        2080,
        2360
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In our opinion the heads of agencies such as Police, Fire, Sanitation, Law, Personnel and City Planning should not hold office in a political party. As Mayor LaGuardia said, \"There is no 'Republican' or 'Democratic' way to clean the streets.\" Nor is there any \"Conservative\" or \"Liberal\" or any other \"political party way\" to run a municipal department. We",
